## Fifty-odd more things that can happen at a meet, written as data. Each is a list of effects
## that evening.gd knows how to carry out. Keys:
##   banner [title, text]      say "toast"          sfx "name"         shake true
##   lines [[who, text, delay]]  (who: a founder id, "any", "any2", "walkon")
##   stir [lines]              gesture [who, anim, seconds]   (who: id | "all" | "keen")
##   walkon {name, role, look, pace, lines}   a stranger who comes in for this
##   runners n                 that many joggers straight through the plaza
##   pickup [label, colour, effects]          something to find and pick up
##   choice [text, [[label, effects], ...]]   a decision
##   money n, snacks n, heat x, health n, stamina n, tip 1, item "id"
##   rep v (every founder), feel {id: v}, tie [a, b, change]
##   dark s, fog s, flash n, chalk_all true, to_gate true, scatter true, gulls true
##   need "condition"          skip unless: "match" (a pull is on), "passer", "night" (after 6:20)

